      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada '...-ish kerak' (borish kerak, tushish kerak) aynan -아야/어야 돼요 ga to'g'ri keladi. 'Qanday borish kerak?' = 어떻게 가야 돼요?",
      "compare_en": "English 'have to / need to' (I have to go, you need to get off) matches -아야/어야 돼요. 'How do I get there?' is literally 'how do I have to go?' = 어떻게 가야 돼요?"
